From efd54a5c2ac60834a552dab71b1ebda2234e433d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] board: karo: add common board support code

Add the common Ka-Ro electronics board code in board/karo/common/:
environment handling (env location selection, MAC address from
fuse/env, U-Boot image variant handling) and FDT loading/fixup
support, together with the Kconfig options (UBOOT_IGNORE_ENV and the
U-Boot image variant choice) sourced from arch/arm/mach-imx/Kconfig.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [karo-specific]
Signed-off-by: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
